        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 74170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop for ini menghitung naik dari <code>1</code> hingga <code>5</code>. Mari pelajari cara mengubahnya agar melakukan perulangan turun dari <code>5</code> hingga <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Counter variable",
            "id": 74172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pertama, kita akan mengubah tempat loop dimulai dengan mengatur variabel penghitung ke <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 74173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Selanjutnya, kita akan mengubah kondisi agar loop <strong>berhenti</strong> ketika <code>i</code> lebih besar dari <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hitung mundur berlanjut selama kondisinya true dan berhenti saat kondisinya menjadi false.</p><p>Tampilkan <code>5</code> hingga <code>1</code>. Letakkan <code>i</code> di kiri dan bandingkan dengan nilai pertama yang tidak boleh ditampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Decrementing",
            "id": 74174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Alih-alih menambah nilai variabel counter, kita menguranginya dengan <code>i--</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>i--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "> and >=",
            "id": 74199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyertakan <code>0</code> saat menghitung mundur, kita menggunakan <code>&gt;=</code>, bukan <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyertakan batas saat menghitung mundur, gunakan <code>&gt;=</code>, bukan <code>&gt;</code>.</p><p>Tampilkan <code>5</code> hingga <code>1</code>. Letakkan <code>i</code> di kiri dan bandingkan dengan nilai terendah yang harus ditampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\"-\" /><text value=\"-\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&gt;=</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 74257,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu bahwa loop ini tidak menjalankan blok kodenya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"-71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Saat loop dimulai, nilai variabel counter kurang dari <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa mengetahui apakah loop menjalankan blok kodenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Saat loop dimulai, nilai variabel counter kurang dari <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mengubah kondisi menjadi <code>i &lt; 0</code>. Apa yang terjadi saat kamu menjalankan loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"-71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop mencatat -71 dan terus menghitung mundur selamanya.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop tetap melewati blok kode karena i dimulai di bawah 0.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop mencatat -71 sekali, lalu pengurangan membuat kondisi menjadi false.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop mencatat -71 dan terus menghitung mundur selamanya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 74258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi saat kita menggunakan <code>i &gt; 0</code> dalam kondisi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop berlanjut selama <code>i</code> lebih besar dari <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop tersebut tidak berfungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop berlanjut selama <code>i</code> lebih besar dari <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop ini memakai <code>i &gt; 0</code> sebagai kondisi. Nilai mana yang mengakhiri hitung mundur karena tidak lagi memenuhi kondisi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing",
            "id": 74259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu bahwa loop ini menghitung mundur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i--</code> berada di dalam tanda kurung</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i++</code> berada di dalam tanda kurung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i--</code> berada di dalam tanda kurung.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah pemanggilan pertama <code>console.log(i)</code>, <code>i--</code> mengubah penghitung menjadi berapa?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: > and >=",
            "id": 74260,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Angka yang menghitung mundur dari <code>5</code> hingga <code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Angka-angka yang menghitung mundur dari <code>5</code> hingga <code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Angka yang menghitung mundur dari <code>5</code> hingga <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mengganti <code>i &gt;= 0</code> dengan <code>i &gt; 0</code>. Berapa angka terakhir yang ditampilkan loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Counter variable",
            "id": 74264,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat variabel counter agar perulangan for berjalan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat variabel counter agar perulangan for berjalan.</p><p>Mulai loop dari nilai yang membuat angka pertama yang ditampilkan menjadi <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>5</code>, dan terakhir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 74265,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuliskan <code>i &gt; 5</code> agar loop berjalan saat <code>i</code> lebih besar dari <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &gt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>i &gt; 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Decrementing",
            "id": 74266,
            "contentType": "interactive",
